description: Colocated Vitest conventions
globs: "**/*.test.ts,**/*.test.tsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Put `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` next to the component or util they cover.
- Use `it.each` for the same assertion across inputs, including edge cases.
- Share setup when two tests would repeat it. Do not build a helper for one call.
- `unknown` is allowed for a mock. `any` is not.

When you add or change a test, follow the `verify-tests` skill: run the file, break one expected value, confirm the failure, restore it, confirm the pass.
